#. <CLT 4>そもそも、なんでモニターなんだ？
#. アナウンスだけでも良かったじゃないか。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0001 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Why do they even need all these monitors? A normal PA\n"
"announcement would work just as well...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
"<CLT 4>Tại sao chúng lại cần tất cả những chiếc màn hình này chứ? Một\n"
"thông báo qua loa bình thường cũng hiệu quả rồi mà...\n"
"<CLT>"

#. <CLT 4>…絵的に寂しいって事か？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0002 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Maybe it's just to give us something to look at.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>いつも見てるのか…？
#. それはそれで飽きないのか？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0003 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Are they always watching us? Don't they ever get tired\n"
"of it...?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
"<CLT 4>Bọn chúng luôn theo dõi chúng ta sao? Chẳng lẽ chúng\n"
"không bao giờ thấy chán à...?\n"
"<CLT>"

#. <CLT 4>…と、心の中で挑発するのが精一杯だ。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0004 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Jeez, it took everything I had even just to *think*\n"
"about mocking them...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
"<CLT 4>Thiệt, mình đã phải dồn hết sức lực chỉ để dám *nghĩ* về\n"
"việc chế nhạo bọn chúng...\n"
"<CLT>"

#. <CLT 4>ここの棚には、食べ物が並んでいる…
#. 料理の食材からお菓子まで…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0005 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>There's all kinds of food here. Ingredients, snacks,\n"
"candy, everything.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>だけど…もう、ここの世話になる事もない…！
#. ボクはファーストフードが食べたいんだ！
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0006 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>But I'm sick of all of it! I wanna go out for dinner!\n"
"I want fast food!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>これだけの生活必需品を集めて…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0007 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>How can they afford all this stuff?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>もしかすると、黒幕は“絶望生中継”とかで、
#. お金まで稼いでるのかもしれないな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0008 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Are they making that much money off their damn\n"
"\"killing game\" broadcast?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>だからこそ、ここまで莫大な資金を使って…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0009 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>That's the only way I can think of for them to be able\n"
"to buy all this.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>だとすると、黒幕は大人だ！
#. 汚い大人に決まってる！
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0010 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Whoever they are, they must be an adult. A dirty,\n"
"awful, evil adult!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

